<h3 class="govuk-heading-s">What happens at a hearing</h3>
<p class="govuk-body">A hearing is an informal discussion led by an Inspector or appointed person.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">At a hearing:</p>
<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
	<li>anyone can speak and share their views on the application</li>
	<li>the Inspector or appointed person will ask questions to clarify facts and evidence</li>
</ul>
<p class="govuk-body">You cannot question or cross-examine other people directly. The Inspector manages the discussion and asks all the questions.</p>
